# Training artifacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
artifacts/checkpoints/
artifacts/runs/
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt

# NOTE: ONNX weights are intentionally NOT ignored.
# See README "Model versioning" - the deployed model is a real, trained,
# 10 MB artefact that must be present in the repository for Render to boot.
# Large future model versions should move to Git LFS (see README).

